WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.560
Keep the room well-lit,
and sit at a proper distance

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.500
when gazing at those
beautiful white underclothes...

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:18.990
Ready for today!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:23.520
Rizel-chan, you're still here?
Tomonori left awhile ago.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:27.510
He gets mad at me if I cling to him,
so I'm going separately!

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:30.330
What? That boy is downright incorrigible!

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.130
No, it's all right!

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.140
Well, I'm off!

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.010
Away, away, and up!

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:12.670
S.O.S.! Dangerous After School!?

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.610
This is Rizel. Papas, come in.

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:19.420
Papa A here.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:22.240
Target passed by 5 minutes ago. Over.

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:23.890
This is Papa B.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.410
Target passing now. Over.

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:31.040
This is Papa C. There are, like,
no obstructions at the checkpoint.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.750
The camera is like totally ready to go. Over.

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.210
Roger!

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:52.450
Rizel's plan was completed in 1 millisecond.

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.770
Let's see that process again.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:58.160
The high-speed, super-ultra-fine wires that Rizel fired latched into place.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:02.320
They pulled Rizel down to the bicycle. And as
soon as she was in place on the baggage rack...

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:06.910
...Papa C used super-highly-sensitive film to photograph them as they passed by.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:12.250
Rizel here! It came out great!
Thank you, Papas!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.530
Ouch! What the hell <i>was</i>  that?!

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:28.440
Rizel...!

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:33.750
What were you up to?!

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.360
Ah! Darling!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.310
I <i>told</i>  you not to follow me around!

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.900
We're all tangled up, Darling.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:45.650
Aaah, damn it!! Why, why me?!

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:50.280
This stuff was developed by NASA,
and is really well-made,

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.180
so struggling might not do any good.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.870
Wow, there's PDA, and then there's this!

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.130
Shut up.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.340
Thank you, Aoi-chan!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.150
Ah, it came untied!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.580
I'm going to school with my husband
for the first time!

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.930
First time going to school together...?!
You're the one who tagged along!

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:11.780
Yay, yay, going to school
with my husband for the first time!

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.570
This is awful...
Yay, yay, going to school
with my husband for the first time!

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:14.030
Ooh, Darling...
Yay, yay, going to school
with my husband for the first time!

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:15.470
C'mon, just a little...?
Ooh, Darling...
Yay, yay, going to school
with my husband for the first time!

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:15.510
Ooh, Darling...
Yay, yay, going to school
with my husband for the first time!

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.340
Yay, yay, hurray!

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.210
It's the first time going to school together!

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:20.460
Rizel, what are you to me?
It's the first time going to school together!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.590
Your wife!

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.870
If you're my wife, will you do what I ask?

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:25.900
Sure! Anything you ask!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:26.840
You sure?

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:27.660
Yeah, yeah!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.840
You're not lying?

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:30.450
No, no, no.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.540
Okay, then go out with somebody else.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.580
Okay!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.390
No takebacks!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.290
Eh? Huh? What??

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.210
He said WHAT?!

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.160
What's he thinking?!

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.170
Could it mean that he hates me?

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:48.380
I wonder if wife-sharing is popular these days...

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:51.050
"Wife-sharing"? Where'd you learn <i>that</i>  term?

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:54.270
Well, it'll turn out okay. Call it a hunch,

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.390
but I think he really has
some feelings for you.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:00.030
Like when he gets all angry?

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:00.480
Er... I don't know about that, but...

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.520
Angry, angry...
Er... I don't know about that, but...

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:06.030
Call it the intuition of a childhood friend.
Trust me, I'm right.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:06.890
Oh, really?

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:07.960
Yeah, really.

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:09.220
Really and truly?

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:09.740
Yeah.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:11.990
Really, truly, absolutely, for real?!?

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.530
I-It's rock solid, I tell you...

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.490
I see...

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:19.160
He just never knows when to quit,
so he can't give up on Sensei so easily...

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.170
Stupid, isn't he?

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:24.160
Why not try dating somebody else?

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:26.380
Then he'll definitely come take you back!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.720
He'll do that?

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.510
There's no doubt he'd reclaim you!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:30.340
Okay!

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:36.110
I wonder who I should try going out with...

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:37.730
Oh, my dear maiden...

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:40.190
The promised weekend has come at last...

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.510
I'm overjoyed!

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:46.020
It's as though an angel has finally been born for me today!

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:48.320
Um... who were you, again?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.170
Oh, you always were such a kidder.

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:53.780
It is I, the one and only Hououin Ryuunosuke!

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:56.930
Nice to meet you! I'm Iwaki Rizel.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:58.730
Ah... pleased to meet you.

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:00.710
Pleased to meet you.

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:04.630
No matter. I'm only after her for her body.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.660
