00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.190
Will you go out with me after school today?

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:11.040
What? You'll go out with me?!

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:12.090
But of course!

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:15.010
Yay! We're going out! Yay, yay!

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:16.640
I'm glad that you are so...

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.720
Okay then, see you later!

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:20.590
