00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.260
Oh, Iwaki-kun?

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.480
W-What?

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:32.450
Are you okay with Rizel-chan getting friendly with
Hououin-kun from Class A?

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.330
So what if she is? Why should I care?

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:38.070
Oh, really? Sorry, then. Bye!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:43.740
What do you mean,
"this time it's a sure thing"?

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:46.230
Well you see, the girl Hououin took home with him today

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:48.800
