00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:52.580
But... doesn't he make figurines of naked girls?

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.090
And we can't forget about
the panty collection!

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:57.890
I've heard he uses the "research" to create doujinshi, as well.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:01.910
As rich as he is, he might make that girl
part of his "collection"!

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:04.280
You mean he'll strip her and use her like a doll, right?

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:05.770
It's more likely than you think!

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.170
Wow...

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.780
This place is like a maze!

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:31.510
I don't quite follow you, but thanks anyway.

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:36.710
Well then... after you!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.640
They're so cute!!

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:46.290
That! And this! And that! And this!

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:48.610
They're all really cute~!

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:50.470
This is...

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.360
...the first time a girl's
ever said that to me.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:55.030
It's amazingly impressive! I'm so moved!

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.030
R-Really?

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:59.420
