to symbolize a pure young girl.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.220
Yes, yes!

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.840
According to my research,

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:15.650
these are the first bear-print panties ever made!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.300
Behold!

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:21.310
In 1953, Count Jean Koenig of England
had this masterpiece

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:24.060
crafted for his granddaughter.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.650
Incredible!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:27.470
The bear on these panties...

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:32.320
