00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.240
You're right!

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:40.690
Indeed... you are a true angel.

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.660
Please, come this way.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:53.970
Wow!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.030
This work is titled "12 Years Old."

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.430
You made this?

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:58.050
Yes.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:02.100
You see, I believe that the
ultimate angel is 12 years old.

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:06.130
Neither adult nor child,
a being in which a pure soul resides.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:07.560
That is a 12-year-old.

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:10.550
I'm apparently 12 years old, too!

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:14.260
But this won't do!
This is not a true 12-year-old!

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:16.010
It's a fake!

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:17.500
That's right, you're the one!

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.410
You are the 12-year-old for whom I have searched so long!

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.630
I want to create... the ultimate angel!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:23.830
I want to create... the ultimate angel!

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:27.770
And for that, I need your 12-year-old body!

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:30.750
So yield to me, and become my very own doll!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:31.320
<i>NOOOO!</i>
So yield to me, and become my very own doll!

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.170
<i>NOOOO!</i>

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:33.990
<i>Noo, Nooooo!</i>

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:34.630
I'll make your beauty last forever!
<i>Noo, Nooooo!</i>

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:37.010
I'll make your beauty last forever!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:40.680
Rize-

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:43.470
...is not my concern.

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:45.890
