00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.150
Save me, Darling!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.860
Like hell I will.

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:05.280
My husband sure will be surprised if I'm wearing this when he comes to get me!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.200
