00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.460
So I can make you into an angel.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:23.430
This is ridiculous...

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.230
Splendid!

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:33.030
You've become my ideal angel!

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:33.990
Who are you?

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:35.090
