00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.480
Thank you, Ryuutarou-kun!

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.940
It's <i>Ryuunosuke,</i> my dear maiden.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.850
I had a <i>really</i>  good time!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:02.030
Darling, wait for me!

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.410
This is the first time I've ever felt this way.

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:10.100
Today, for the first time in my life,
I have fallen in love with a 12-year-old girl!

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:14.180
Now that I've come this far,
I won't stop until I take her from him!

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.460
I'll do it with my own two hands!

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:21.100
Ahhhh... feels nice.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.050
Here, have a bath towel.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.880
Thank you, Darling!

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.550
I'm so happy. This is the "first" jealousy incident.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.640
